    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Xi as she tries to navigate a five-day time loop and figure out what happened to her memories. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Together with her companion, Ouro, travel through a true metroidvania world where time changes the terrain in subtle ways. Escape the loop through exploration and battle. Change Xi\u2019s fate and learn the truth of the Dragon Loop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059210/extras/1df739fe2707904fe82e170a8d4b3ef0.avif?t=1754569097\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Turn Bosses into Summonable Spirits</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat a wide range of interesting bosses to get exclusive summonable spirits. Destroy your foes with powerful Explosive Spirits, or summon Persistent Spirit companions to follow you around. Upgrade and evolve both types to enhance their combat power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059210/extras/cbe171e9e66cd4137c772b3ba2e11893.poster.avif?t=1754569097\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059210/extras/cbe171e9e66cd4137c772b3ba2e11893.webm?t=1754569097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059210/extras/cbe171e9e66cd4137c772b3ba2e11893.mp4?t=1754569097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Multipurpose Metroidvania Powers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find rare Pearls to summon powerful tools that help you traverse the world. Spiky pufferfish, magnetic boxes, a vacuuming whale spirit\u2026 and more. Each has multiple uses in both combat and traversing the world, unlocking many ways to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059210/extras/d5f19ae7e2af2c38ac75f487bd2b591f.poster.avif?t=1754569097\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059210/extras/d5f19ae7e2af2c38ac75f487bd2b591f.webm?t=1754569097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059210/extras/d5f19ae7e2af2c38ac75f487bd2b591f.mp4?t=1754569097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fast-Paced Exciting Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine Xi\u2019s strength with Ouro\u2019s agility in fast-paced combat. Play well, manage your X-Rating, and boost your speed and combat power even further in this fast-paced combat system with no contact damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059210/extras/e6f40ec9b00335a315b4f8630ff29e8f.poster.avif?t=1754569097\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059210/extras/e6f40ec9b00335a315b4f8630ff29e8f.webm?t=1754569097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059210/extras/e6f40ec9b00335a315b4f8630ff29e8f.mp4?t=1754569097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Branches in Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Dragon Loop, time is a limited resource. Use your five days wisely and plan your routes through an easily-navigable Time Map. Explore and open up new worldlines to see how things play out differently.But don\u2019t worry: this isn\u2019t a roguelike; you never start from scratch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059210/extras/b3409acfceb5a616cb9a30bc5d4a070d.poster.avif?t=1754569097\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059210/extras/b3409acfceb5a616cb9a30bc5d4a070d.webm?t=1754569097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059210/extras/b3409acfceb5a616cb9a30bc5d4a070d.mp4?t=1754569097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Xi as she tries to navigate a five-day time loop and figure out what happened to her memories. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Together with her companion, Ouro, travel through a true metroidvania world where time changes the terrain in subtle ways. Escape the loop through exploration and battle. Change Xi\u2019s fate and learn the truth of the Dragon Loop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059210/extras/1df739fe2707904fe82e170a8d4b3ef0.avif?t=1754569097\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Turn Bosses into Summonable Spirits</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat a wide range of interesting bosses to get exclusive summonable spirits. Destroy your foes with powerful Explosive Spirits, or summon Persistent Spirit companions to follow you around. Upgrade and evolve both types to enhance their combat power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059210/extras/cbe171e9e66cd4137c772b3ba2e11893.poster.avif?t=1754569097\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059210/extras/cbe171e9e66cd4137c772b3ba2e11893.webm?t=1754569097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059210/extras/cbe171e9e66cd4137c772b3ba2e11893.mp4?t=1754569097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Multipurpose Metroidvania Powers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find rare Pearls to summon powerful tools that help you traverse the world. Spiky pufferfish, magnetic boxes, a vacuuming whale spirit\u2026 and more. Each has multiple uses in both combat and traversing the world, unlocking many ways to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059210/extras/d5f19ae7e2af2c38ac75f487bd2b591f.poster.avif?t=1754569097\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059210/extras/d5f19ae7e2af2c38ac75f487bd2b591f.webm?t=1754569097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059210/extras/d5f19ae7e2af2c38ac75f487bd2b591f.mp4?t=1754569097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fast-Paced Exciting Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine Xi\u2019s strength with Ouro\u2019s agility in fast-paced combat. Play well, manage your X-Rating, and boost your speed and combat power even further in this fast-paced combat system with no contact damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059210/extras/e6f40ec9b00335a315b4f8630ff29e8f.poster.avif?t=1754569097\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059210/extras/e6f40ec9b00335a315b4f8630ff29e8f.webm?t=1754569097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059210/extras/e6f40ec9b00335a315b4f8630ff29e8f.mp4?t=1754569097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Branches in Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Dragon Loop, time is a limited resource. Use your five days wisely and plan your routes through an easily-navigable Time Map. Explore and open up new worldlines to see how things play out differently.But don\u2019t worry: this isn\u2019t a roguelike; you never start from scratch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059210/extras/b3409acfceb5a616cb9a30bc5d4a070d.poster.avif?t=1754569097\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059210/extras/b3409acfceb5a616cb9a30bc5d4a070d.webm?t=1754569097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059210/extras/b3409acfceb5a616cb9a30bc5d4a070d.mp4?t=1754569097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "short_description": "Dragon Loop is a metroidvania combining time travel and branching map design. Explore the large open world in a five day loop, opening up new worldlines. Explore a 2D, hand-drawn world, engage in fast-paced battles, and retrieve memories to shape the future.",
    "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese, English",
    "reviews": "\u201c5/5. High fit. The game starts slowly; you gain free exploration after the second loop. After that, original upgrades and exploration are amazing. The music can become a little repetitive. S (30hs)\u201d<br>The Metroidvania Review<br><br>\u201c\u4ec0\u4e48\uff01\u4e00\u5468\u76ee\u82b1\u4e8628\u5c0f\u65f6\uff1f\uff1f\u4f46\u662f\uff0c\u4eca\u5e74\u771f\u7684\u662f\u6211\u73a9\u8fc7\u94f6\u6cb3\u57ce\u91cc\u6700\u597d\u73a9\u8d85\u597d\u73a9\u7684\u6e38\u620f\u4e86\u3002 \u800c\u4e14\u771f\u7ed3\u5c40\u771f\u7684\u611f\u4eba\uff01\uff01\u8fd9\u51e0\u5929\u966a\u4f34\u6211\u7684\u65c5\u7a0b\uff0c\u8854\u5c3e\u5c31\u50cf\u662f\u6211\u7684\u670b\u53cb\uff0c\u4e00\u4f1a\u6307\u5f15\u6211\uff0c\u4e00\u4f1a\u5f00\u51b7\u7b11\u8bdd\u3002\u5230\u6700\u540e\u8ddf\u8854\u5c3e\u3002\u3002\u3002 \u201c\u5728\u90a3\u9065\u8fdc\u800c\u53c8\u5145\u6ee1\u672a\u77e5\u7684\u672a\u6765\uff0c\u613f\u6211\u4eec\u8fd8\u80fd\u518d\u6b21\u76f8\u9047\u201c\u201d<br>\u7504\u6e38\u7ec4<br><br>\u201c\u6e38\u620f\u8bc4\u5206\uff1a9/10 \u8bc4\u6d4b\u8bbe\u5907\uff1aGPD WIN MINI \u4ee5\u65f6\u95f4\u5faa\u73af\u91cd\u6784\u94f6\u6cb3\u57ce\u9aa8\u67b6\uff0c\u7528\u7cbe\u7075\u6536\u670d\u4e0e\u9053\u5177\u590d\u7528\u6ce8\u5165\u7075\u9b42\u3002\u867d\u6709\u5c0f\u7455\uff0c\u4f46\u200b\u200b2D\u624b\u7ed8\u7f8e\u5b66+\u591a\u5468\u76ee\u589e\u91cf\u5185\u5bb9\u200b\u200b\u4ecd\u4f7f\u5176\u6210\u4e3a2025\u5e74\u6700\u60ca\u559c\u7684\u56fd\u4ea7\u7c7b\u94f6\u6cb3\u57ce\u4e4b\u4f5c\u3002 \u5b9e\u6d4b\u652f\u6301\u624b\u67c4\uff0c\u4efb\u610fTDP\u5747\u53ef\u6d41\u7545\u8fd0\u884c\u3002\u201d<br>GPD\u638c\u673a<br>",
